### 1. Organization and SCPs

First, create an AWS Organization and apply Service Control Policies (SCPs).

```hcl
# main.tf
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

resource "aws_organizations_organization" "org" {
  aws_service_access_principals = ["cloudtrail.amazonaws.com", "config.amazonaws.com"]
